# Gmail SMTP Configuration for Contact Form
# To use Gmail:
# 1. Enable 2-Factor Authentication on your Gmail account
# 2. Generate an App Password at: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Copy your Gmail address and the generated 16-character app password below

GMAIL_USER=bemnet.important@gmail.com
GMAIL_PASSWORD=your_16_character_app_password_here
